---
source: crates/elasticctl-cli/tests/value_lists.rs
expression: help
---
Manage value lists

Usage: elasticctl value-lists [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  list      List value-list containers
  get       Show a value list, counts, and warnings
  validate  Validate a local value-list pair without server contact
  export    Export value-list pairs without overwriting files
  import    Import a value-list pair with exact value reconciliation
  delete    Delete value lists and their values
  init      Bootstrap the space's list data streams
  help      Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --profile <PROFILE>  Use a named profile
      --config <CONFIG>    Use a specific configuration file
      --space <SPACE>      Kibana space to operate in
      --json               Force JSON output
      --format <FORMAT>    Output format: table, json, yaml, csv, jsonl
      --fields <FIELDS>    Comma-separated fields to include
      --out <OUT>          Write output to a file instead of stdout
  -y, --yes                Apply a mutation after reviewing its preview
      --timeout <TIMEOUT>  Request timeout in seconds
      --debug              Log HTTP requests and responses, with secrets redacted
  -h, --help               Print help
